      <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jan 2022 09:00:43 -0600</pubDate>
      <title>Create Your New Golf Account Easily in foreUP Today</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">50843482</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/307cf5a</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #DCDCDC; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#DCDCDC"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="padding: 0px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 10px;">Having trouble viewing this email? <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/307cf5a">View it as a Web page</a>.</p>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/03/3211710/3000446/govdelivery-important-update-01_crop.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Important Update from Columbus Recreation and Parks Department" width="600" height="160"></td></tr></table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 class="govd_header" style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; text-align: left; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Create Your New Golf Account Easily in foreUP Today</h1>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #CB343C; font-size: 18px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Congratulations to Jay Elston for winning the first prize drawing for registering his new foreUP account. Jay will receive two dozen Pro V1 golf balls just for registering. </h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>The next drawing will be on Tuesday, Feb. 8, so take a minute to register your new account, and you will be automatically <strong>entered </strong>into the drawing!</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">We are upgrading our point of sale system with foreUP to help streamline and manage our six golf courses. This is a great step forward for our department, and we look forward to serving you even better with this new system.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">To make booking your next round of golf online a quick and easy process, we just need you to create your account in our new system. This only takes a minute, and it will allow you to book and manage your tee times efficiently.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you go online and create your account, you will be entered into bi-weekly drawings for prizes. The sooner you create your account, the more chances you have to win! The prizes will be good items -- prizes that you will actually want!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Follow the step-by-step instructions listed below to create your account.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Create Your Own Account Instructions: </strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;">Start here: <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/foreupsoftware.com/index.php/booking/21526/8135*teetimes__;Iw!!J-4R7rTSYA!K1apRIcC7Muq9RiFapruy_c-eKeKefxAYPAr8AR7M71c-cnomR-cV2ngyQ2nsBxTtvQ%24?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://foreupsoftware.com/index.php/booking/21526/8135#teetimes</a>.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;">Click on the login button on the top right of the screen.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;">Click the blue "Sign Up For Free" button.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;">Enter your information as it will appear in the online booking system (email address is required).</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;">Click "Register."</li>
</ul>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Complete these steps, and you are now set up! You are now also entered into our bi-weekly drawings for great prizes! Winners will be notified, and prizes can be picked up at the golf courses. Thank you for taking a minute to create your new account in foreUP. </p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
